            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.22.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 22.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " It is actually reported that there is immorality among you, and of a kind that is not found even among pagans; for a man is living with his father's wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you are arrogant! Ought you not rather to mourn? Let him who has done this be removed from among you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
